msgstr "Ativar o módulo de IU de conjunto de opções para gerenciar os conjuntos de opções."

msgid "Leave empty to not use thumbnail/ pager."
msgstr ""

msgid "<strong>Supported types</strong>: basic Image title, and fields like a dedicated field Title, Link, etc. If an entity, be sure its formatter is strings like ID or Label. As opposed to <strong>Caption fields</strong>, it will be positioned and wrapped with H2 (overriden by <code>hook_blazy_item_alter() with blazies.item.title_tag</code>) and a dedicated class: <strong>@module__title</strong>."
